# Feature architecture

- `src/app/`: layouts and route entry files only — re-export `*Page` from `src/features/`.
- `src/features/<name>/`: one domain per folder (`*Page.tsx`, `components/`, `hooks/`, `services/`, `types/`).
- `src/shared/`: cross-feature UI, hooks, `lib/`, `constants/`, `apiClient`.
- Style with `StyleSheet` and themed components in `src/shared/`; do not add Tailwind/shadcn unless explicitly requested.
- Features do not import other features; lift shared code to `src/shared/`.
- New screen: add feature page + `src/app/<route>.tsx` re-export; register in `_layout` / tabs if needed.
